00:00:09.219 --> 00:00:11.392
- So, when I first got Instagram,

00:00:11.392 --> 00:00:13.308
I thought it was just a photo editing app.

00:00:13.308 --> 00:00:16.234
I didn't realize it was a social network.

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:19.600
So I was just going on an
editing pictures for funsies.

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:22.027
Here's my first one.

00:00:22.027 --> 00:00:23.989
Paperclips.

00:00:23.989 --> 00:00:26.950
It might have been my phone
background for a hot minute.

00:00:26.950 --> 00:00:28.238
- I post pretty often and I'd say that

00:00:28.238 --> 00:00:31.083
I've gone through several
phases with how I use Instagram.

00:00:31.083 --> 00:00:32.662
It's called "dART" because

00:00:32.662 --> 00:00:34.368
it's dartboard with a Coca Cola can.

00:00:34.368 --> 00:00:36.412
This is when I started
incorporating branding,

00:00:36.412 --> 00:00:38.374
so people know I'm open for sponsorship.

00:00:38.374 --> 00:00:40.092
- Definitely. Did it work?

00:00:40.092 --> 00:00:40.800
- No.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:42.501
- Very first one is,

00:00:42.501 --> 00:00:46.331
I was drunk and I just
wrote a caption that says,

00:00:46.331 --> 00:00:48.852
"be afraid, be very afraid."

00:00:48.852 --> 00:00:51.302
And I guess I was trying to scare people

00:00:51.302 --> 00:00:52.718
that I was on Instagram.

00:00:52.718 --> 00:00:53.473
- (host) What is that?

00:00:53.473 --> 00:00:54.436
- An umbrella.

00:00:54.436 --> 00:00:55.307
- (host) Are you sure it's an umbrella,

00:00:55.307 --> 00:00:57.592
it looks like one of those tiki umbrellas

00:00:57.592 --> 00:00:58.686
that you put in your drink.

00:00:58.686 --> 00:01:01.031
- It wasn't the cheapy plastic umbrellas

00:01:01.031 --> 00:01:01.983
from the Dollar Store.

00:01:01.983 --> 00:01:04.317
It was one of those table umbrellas

00:01:04.317 --> 00:01:05.779
at the University of Miami.

00:01:05.779 --> 00:01:07.440
And I was just sitting
there bored, I guess.

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:10.075
And I was like, hmm, time to take a photo.

00:01:10.075 --> 00:01:11.956
- Art is everywhere.

00:01:11.956 --> 00:01:13.024
- It got two likes.

00:01:13.024 --> 00:01:15.160
- For those of you who can't tell,

00:01:15.160 --> 00:01:17.946
there's milk in the Brita pitcher.

00:01:17.946 --> 00:01:18.957
- Gross.

00:01:18.957 --> 00:01:21.546
- One drunken night I accidentally,

00:01:21.546 --> 00:01:23.636
not accidentally, I obviously
did this on purpose,

00:01:23.636 --> 00:01:25.133
I have no recollection, but,

00:01:25.133 --> 00:01:26.968
I poured milk into a Brita pitcher.

00:01:26.968 --> 00:01:28.418
- Okay, so, I though Instagram at first

00:01:28.418 --> 00:01:29.719
was a filter app.

00:01:29.719 --> 00:01:32.099
Like, specifically just
to filter things, so,

00:01:32.099 --> 00:01:34.270
my friend was like "hey,
you got a long board?"

00:01:34.270 --> 00:01:36.267
and I was like "Yeah, I'm
a cool kid in college,

00:01:36.267 --> 00:01:37.567
I got a long board."

00:01:37.567 --> 00:01:38.937
So, I literally took the photo thinking

00:01:38.937 --> 00:01:40.482
only it would save,

00:01:40.482 --> 00:01:42.780
I didn't know any of my
first photos were here

00:01:42.780 --> 00:01:43.651
for the world to see.

00:01:43.651 --> 00:01:45.485
But, the thirst was very real for like,

00:01:45.485 --> 00:01:47.366
first years of college stuff.

00:01:47.366 --> 00:01:49.119
Like, dry as the Sahara dessert,

00:01:49.119 --> 00:01:52.034
I wanna find me a woman thirsty.

00:01:52.034 --> 00:01:52.521
- Okay.

00:01:52.521 --> 00:01:56.664
- Oh my god, this is so embarrassing.

00:01:56.664 --> 00:01:59.752
